edrawings-kit contains the separately developed hsf-core Rust parser.
The backend identity is recorded in hsf-backend.lock.json and build_info().
Source builds resolve the pinned hsf-core release from crates.io.

edrawings-kit and hsf-core are licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
See LICENSE for the full terms. The hsf-core attribution is reproduced in
edrawings_kit/_licenses/hsf-core-NOTICE.

Third-party Rust dependency license expressions, checksums and complete
license texts are in edrawings_kit/_licenses/. Their terms are preserved.
The inventory includes build dependencies and all Cargo target dependencies.

The source archive includes only the explicitly hash-verified, project-authored
native drawing regression fixtures. Third-party research CAD files, vendor
software, fonts and the HOOPS SDK are not included.

eDrawings and SOLIDWORKS are names of their respective owners. This project
is an independent parser and is not an official vendor product.
